                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#44546A', lineHeight: 1.4, fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>IPO募资42.02亿元到账，叠加美团、蚂蚁、红杉中国、腾讯、阿里等产业与财务股东</Text>
